{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-principles","title":"测试原则与测试金字塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/foundations/testing-principles","wordCount":1601,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试原则与测试金字塔\">测试原则与测试金字塔</h1><p>考虑一个只接受两个 32 位整数的加法函数。它的输入空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32} \\times 2^{32} = 2^{64}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种组合，即便每秒能跑十亿个用例，穷举一遍也要超过五百年。这个简单到不能再简单的例子揭示了软件测试最根本的事实：<strong>穷尽测试是不可能的</strong>。既然不可能测全，测试这门学科的全部价值就转移到了一个问题上——如何用有限的精力，覆盖风险最高的那一小部分。测试金字塔与一组经典测试原则，正是回答这个问题的两件基本工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>测试金字塔由 Mike Cohn 在《Scrum 敏捷软件开发》中提出，它按「执行速度」与「单位成本」把测试分层：越往下，测试越快、越便宜、越稳定、数量越多；越往上，测试越慢、越贵、越脆、数量越少。这个形状不是审美选择，而是经济学结论——把验证尽量下沉到便宜的层级，才能在每次提交时都跑得起全套验证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[端到端测试&lt;br/&gt;少量·慢·贵·脆&lt;br/&gt;真实系统真实浏览器] --&gt; B[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;中等·验证组件拼接处]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;大量·快·廉·稳&lt;br/&gt;隔离单个函数或类]&#10;    D[反模式: 冰淇淋蛋筒&lt;br/&gt;大量E2E压顶·单元空虚] -.对照.-&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[端到端测试&lt;br/&gt;少量·慢·贵·脆&lt;br/&gt;真实系统真实浏览器] --&gt; B[集成测试&lt;br/&gt;中等·验证组件拼接处]\n    B --&gt; C[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;大量·快·廉·稳&lt;br/&gt;隔离单个函数或类]\n    D[反模式: 冰淇淋蛋筒&lt;br/&gt;大量E2E压顶·单元空虚] -.对照.-&gt; A</pre><p>与之相对的两个反模式同样著名：<strong>冰淇淋蛋筒</strong>（Ice Cream Cone）把大量缓慢的端到端测试堆在顶上、底座空虚，导致 CI 又慢又频繁误报；<strong>沙漏</strong>（Hourglass）则两头粗中间细，缺失集成层，使得「单元都对、端到端也勉强能过，但服务拼接处不断出锅」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>验证对象</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>隔离程度</th>\n<th>数量占比（健康套件）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元</td>\n<td>单个函数/类的逻辑</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>完全隔离（用测试替身）</td>\n<td>约 70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成</td>\n<td>多个组件/服务的协作</td>\n<td>百毫秒至秒级</td>\n<td>部分真实依赖</td>\n<td>约 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>完整用户旅程</td>\n<td>秒至分钟级</td>\n<td>几乎无隔离</td>\n<td>约 10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单元测试如何做到「完全隔离」是一门专门技术，见 <a href=\"../test-levels/unit-testing\">单元测试与测试替身</a>；集成层的契约思想见 <a href=\"../test-levels/integration-testing\">集成与契约测试</a>；端到端为何昂贵又脆弱见 <a href=\"../test-levels/e2e-testing\">端到端与系统测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"七条经典测试原则\">七条经典测试原则</h2><p>国际软件测试资格认证（ISTQB）总结的七条原则，至今仍是从业者的共同语言。它们不是教条，而是无数项目踩坑后的提炼。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>测试只能证明缺陷存在，不能证明缺陷不存在</strong>。这是 Dijkstra 的著名论断。通过的测试只说明「在这些情况下没发现问题」，永远无法证明软件无 bug。第二，<strong>穷尽测试不可行</strong>，前面的加法例子已经说明，必须用风险与优先级替代穷举。第三，<strong>测试应尽早介入</strong>（early testing，又称左移），需求阶段的一个缺陷若漏到生产环境，修复成本可能放大几十倍。第四，<strong>缺陷倾向于聚集</strong>（defect clustering），符合帕累托分布——少数模块往往集中了大多数缺陷，测试资源应向它们倾斜。</p>\n<p>第五，<strong>杀虫剂悖论</strong>（pesticide paradox）：同一组测试反复跑会逐渐失效，因为它能发现的 bug 早已被修掉，必须不断更新与补充用例——这正是 <a href=\"../advanced-techniques/mutation-testing\">变异测试</a> 和 <a href=\"../advanced-techniques/property-based-testing\">基于属性的测试</a> 试图缓解的问题。第六，<strong>测试依赖上下文</strong>：电商网站与心脏起搏器的测试策略截然不同。第七，<strong>「无缺陷」是谬误</strong>：一个完美符合规格却没人用的产品，质量依然为零——测试必须服务于真实需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺陷成本随时间放大\">缺陷成本随时间放大</h2><p>左移之所以重要，根源在于缺陷修复成本随发现阶段呈指数级上升。若把需求阶段修复一个缺陷的成本记为单位 1，业界经验研究（如 Boehm 的成本模型）给出的粗略放大规律可表示为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fix</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fix}}(t) \\approx C_0 \\cdot r^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是缺陷从引入到被发现所跨越的阶段数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是每跨一个阶段的放大系数（经验值常落在 5 到 10 之间）。一个在编码阶段就被单元测试抓住的空指针，可能只花几分钟；同一个缺陷漏到生产环境，则要叠加上线回滚、客户投诉、紧急排障、数据修复等成本，轻易膨胀上百倍。这就是为什么金字塔底部那些「不起眼」的快测试，在经济上反而最划算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需求阶段引入缺陷] --&gt; B{何时发现?}&#10;    B --&gt;|单元测试| C[成本约 1x&lt;br/&gt;分钟级修复]&#10;    B --&gt;|集成测试| D[成本约 5x]&#10;    B --&gt;|端到端/验收| E[成本约 25x]&#10;    B --&gt;|生产环境| F[成本约 100x+&lt;br/&gt;含回滚与客诉]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需求阶段引入缺陷] --&gt; B{何时发现?}\n    B --&gt;|单元测试| C[成本约 1x&lt;br/&gt;分钟级修复]\n    B --&gt;|集成测试| D[成本约 5x]\n    B --&gt;|端到端/验收| E[成本约 25x]\n    B --&gt;|生产环境| F[成本约 100x+&lt;br/&gt;含回滚与客诉]</pre><h2 id=\"风险驱动-从-测全-到-测对\">风险驱动：从「测全」到「测对」</h2><p>2026 年主流 QA 实践的一个明确转向，是从「我们测了多少」转向「风险集中在哪里」。随着系统演化为微服务、Serverless、边缘部署与 AI 特性的混合体，行为越来越依赖上下文与个性化，穷举式覆盖彻底失去意义（参见 testomat.io 与 Testlio 对 2026 趋势的总结）。风险驱动测试（risk-based testing）用两个维度给每个功能打分——<strong>发生概率</strong>与<strong>影响严重度</strong>——并按风险值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = P \\times S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 排序，把有限的测试精力优先投向高风险区域。</p>\n<p>这套思路与缺陷聚集原则天然契合：既然缺陷扎堆，就该用变更频率、历史缺陷密度、代码复杂度等信号定位「热点」模块，集中火力。它也解释了现代测试金字塔为何在 2026 年常被画成「中段更宽」的样子——微服务架构下，服务间集成才是风险真正聚集之处。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>风险值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>测试策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>多层覆盖 + 进阶技术（属性/模糊）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>单元 + 关键路径集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>少量单元，或仅靠类型系统兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>穷尽测试不可能，因此测试的核心是「在有限精力下覆盖最高风险」。</li>\n<li>测试金字塔按速度与成本分层：底宽（单元）、中等（集成）、顶尖（端到端）；冰淇淋蛋筒与沙漏是两大反模式。</li>\n<li>ISTQB 七原则提供共同语言，其中「缺陷聚集」「早期测试」「杀虫剂悖论」直接影响策略制定。</li>\n<li>缺陷修复成本随发现阶段指数放大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fix</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fix}} \\approx C_0 r^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9436em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），这是测试左移与金字塔下沉的经济学依据。</li>\n<li>2026 年实践从「测全」转向「风险驱动」，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = P \\times S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 排序，把火力投向缺陷热点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试原则与测试金字塔","id":"测试原则与测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"七条经典测试原则","id":"七条经典测试原则"},{"level":2,"text":"缺陷成本随时间放大","id":"缺陷成本随时间放大"},{"level":2,"text":"风险驱动：从「测全」到「测对」","id":"风险驱动-从-测全-到-测对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"测试用例设计技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/foundations/test-design-techniques"}}